9", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499314641_2334058800454382_6810420958056556067_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iLvPyiGNa6UQ7kNvwEvIpcN&_nc_oc=AdrwLw0vrG3WqxkR2OcBnwGzEFPY_xtSdYsXBqblS8v2SfVqxwvL1QEX7xUusUg0j8o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJajHqDLciX1XpPoz5S92map7bvz4su5ctEZR0f8x_hOg&oe=6AA00EDB"}, {"file_name": "com.onenightcircus.fields-20251218-203353.png", "id": "1290753326156435", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312236_1290753329489768_4332884711738293422_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Pw50QZdl3oEQ7kNvwFvh078&_nc_oc=AdoN_8s1VXxswDit4gNLVYj838pgYi7oD4DEuF2q7CnGGgUXUvsYrldUvk8fy_eZ0nQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJVY0X2PTh4Sewz0xIWnJG6eFSv6q7iqmzYusjmRLgqXQ&oe=6AA00E81"}, {"file_name": "com.onenightcircus.fields-20251218-203201.png", "id": "1926405484733596", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312338_1926405491400262_5342535590335345652_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VM5HkneOXacQ7kNvwHWUHfR&_nc_oc=AdoK92e_v61aNYuHWqbnAbp_2cLsPFk_lUsioRTTYdQ8BtZmuqTJ2bRNoiw6O7YCr3s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJqNNNdxggijOUy7Rg10ytvFJyNwplatNCzuj_ddL_l5w&oe=6A9FFA5D"}, {"file_name": "com.onenightcircus.fields-20251218-203301.png", "id": "974613512240519", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312470_974613515573852_1573452143751525995_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FTEf7qg4Dw4Q7kNvwH8cqd_&_nc_oc=AdrYx_ce4eVuP18GuYmrGgsrlKNOqTmMAvqk_5KlBAzVJ3CyB2Cq5tKfjL6xSp3RzNQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQL1TNqMgqWeMUem7viz1ll7uU1So2u-H5ds7nHI8p_VIw&oe=6A9FFC3F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "fields-artwork-v2-2560x1440.png", "id": "1690141432030718", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499311597_1690141435364051_2132099073325899983_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kjKEU2gVvdUQ7kNvwG4NYY7&_nc_oc=AdqYbLQAYIko_RUd0xiGMxl5-oZsDYrnhZXhlXjmX4_hYCeKfMqGvNci_M_SI9JmFrs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJsbSgAD-8kLkU4oEiz8PS7NTQeFrHqPejyxgQJwsnGCw&oe=6AA028EE"}, "display_name": "Fields", "keywords": ["music", "inmersive", "art", "visuals", "meditation"], "long_description": "Fields is not an album you listen to. It is a place you enter.\n\nAn immersive VR experience built around the music of electronic producer Die Stadt, Fields dissolves the boundary between sound and space. Each track becomes an environment: shifting fields of light, generative textures, and slow chromatic movements that respond to the music in real time.\n\nFields is designed for deep listening \u2014 a rare kind of attention that VR makes possible. No narrative, no objectives. Only presence.\nWhat you will find inside:\n\n- A full-length electronic music album experienced as a living, breathing space.\n- Generative visuals that evolve with the music.\n- Designed for extended, contemplative sessions.\n- Optimized for Meta Quest 3.\n\nFields is an album. Fields is a place. Now you can enter both.\n\nStep in.\n{1548057873348580}", "short_description": "Step inside the music of electronic/ambient producer Die Stadt. Sound becomes space. Space becomes music."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "uba_APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE.png", "id": "2273186383217800", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307451_2273186386551133_8686410893456982869_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dXm_txG69tQQ7kNvwFQ__zc&_nc_oc=AdqNRRPFfnMLNyTV7Ddl6yzQgx-gs7-zxrYLUT5TydUgLz1E-iRm3pjxJ_bOYaoKjWc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJDoRaRchDKVijo1e68xBw29zrktXHbeJCrN7cL-AyN3A&oe=6AA021DF"}, {"file_name": "fields_logotipo_512x512.png", "id": "2080711572861858", "image_type": "APP_IMG_L